{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121394","id":4057995109,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7x4Bdl","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121394","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121394.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121394.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121394","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121394/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121394/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121394/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c10bb38eb1f1f3a83cc6f1dc1410af1ba13fe0cf","number":121394,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix gizmo & Add `use_rest_for_limitation` to IterateIK/LookAtModifier","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119664\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe issue with #119664 was that the internal processing did not match the Gizmo. This PR ensures that the Gizmo now matches.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"493\" height=\"357\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71acd168-de9d-4fe9-93fc-abf0dc8f15a6\" />\r\n\r\nAfter fix:\r\n<img width=\"536\" height=\"382\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ce70dc0-9c61-425a-9b01-39387ad608e2\" />\r\n\r\nAlso, this PR adds an option to set the limitations mentioned in #119664 to the rest based; the `use_rest_for_limitation` option to `IterateIK3D` and `LookAtModifier3D`. This allows Limitation to use the static `bone_rest` space instead of the `bone_pose` space immediately before the IK is processed.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"517\" height=\"190\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0acd74b5-af66-4590-8747-1700e42a9dc2\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"444\" height=\"358\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87dbade3-b7f6-4fd2-91c1-1b385bfc00f1\" />\r\n\r\n[adjusted-ik-3d-demo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30034528/adjusted-ik-3d-demo.zip)\r\n\r\nTo maintain backward compatibility, the default value is `false`. Incidentally, this option has an impact particularly when pre-aiming is being performed.\r\n\r\nFor example, the [adjusted-ik-3d-demo.zip](https://godotengine.org/storage/blog/inverse-kinematics-returns-to-godot-4-6/adjusted-ik-3d-demo.zip) in https://godotengine.org/article/inverse-kinematics-returns-to-godot-4-6/ performs pre-aiming, and this pre-aiming serves the role of providing behavior similar to a pole. Therefore, it makes sense that there are use cases where this option is set to false.\r\n\r\nThe essence of implementing this option is simply to have `bone_rest.inverted() * bone_pose` taken into account in limitation's space. And I have added documentation clarifying that `use_rest_for_limitation` refers to the limitation space relative to the result calculated within this Modifier. If one wishes to limit pre input pose, it is the role of a separate Modifier (like PoseResetter) or an option (such as `relative=false` in `LookAtModifier3D`).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g